{"unit_id":"Luminet-LT__dsh-inapp-chat#card-zh","repo":"Luminet-LT/dsh-inapp-chat","commit":"d3e048679286dd960c6df8ef2bbb203142e39a8f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-inapp-chat 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页客户端的插件，在侧边栏底部添加「网页对话」入口，并通过桌面开窗桥接打开 DeepSeek 对话页面。它会在桌面桥接可用时开启独立应用窗口；桥接缺失或失败时，在桌面壳内显示说明和备用操作，在普通浏览器中则打开新标签页。设置页提供入口显示开关，偏好保存在插件设置作用域或本地存储中。适合希望在处理项目时另开窗口查资料、问问题或排查报错的 Harness 用户。对话内容在 DeepSeek 网页中进行，插件没有项目文件读取入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:136-157","lib/client.js:450-485","lib/client.js:551-569","lib/index.js:824-830"]}
{"unit_id":"Luminet-LT__dsh-inapp-chat#card-en","repo":"Luminet-LT/dsh-inapp-chat","commit":"d3e048679286dd960c6df8ef2bbb203142e39a8f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-inapp-chat adds a sidebar link in DeepSeek Harness to open DeepSeek chat. It uses the desktop window bridge, shows a fallback dialog if unavailable in a desktop shell, and opens a new tab in a regular browser. A settings toggle controls the link for quick side questions while working.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:136-157","lib/client.js:450-485","lib/client.js:551-569","lib/index.js:824-830"]}
