{"unit_id":"Luminet-LT__dsh-inapp-chat#feature-1","repo":"Luminet-LT/dsh-inapp-chat","commit":"d3e048679286dd960c6df8ef2bbb203142e39a8f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-inapp-chat 的功能「侧边栏网页对话」：在 Harness 侧栏底部添加网页对话入口。点击后优先通过桌面桥接在独立窗口打开 DeepSeek。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:313-329","lib/client.js:452-475","lib/client.js:136-149"]}
{"unit_id":"Luminet-LT__dsh-inapp-chat#feature-2","repo":"Luminet-LT/dsh-inapp-chat","commit":"d3e048679286dd960c6df8ef2bbb203142e39a8f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-inapp-chat 的功能「开窗备用处理」：桌面壳缺少开窗桥接或调用失败时显示应用内说明对话框；用户可选择系统浏览器打开、复制提示命令或关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:136-157","lib/client.js:221-250"]}
{"unit_id":"Luminet-LT__dsh-inapp-chat#feature-3","repo":"Luminet-LT/dsh-inapp-chat","commit":"d3e048679286dd960c6df8ef2bbb203142e39a8f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-inapp-chat 的功能「入口显示设置」：在通用设置中提供网页对话入口开关，关闭后移除侧栏入口；偏好通过设置作用域保存，缺少作用域时回退到本地存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:77-106","lib/client.js:450-485","lib/client.js:551-569","lib/index.js:824-830"]}
{"unit_id":"Luminet-LT__dsh-inapp-chat#feature-4","repo":"Luminet-LT/dsh-inapp-chat","commit":"d3e048679286dd960c6df8ef2bbb203142e39a8f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-inapp-chat 的功能「浏览器新标签打开」：普通浏览器没有桌面桥接时，入口链接保留新标签页行为，避免把 Harness 当前页面替换为对话页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:151-157","lib/client.js:320-327"]}
{"unit_id":"Luminet-LT__dsh-inapp-chat#caveat-1","repo":"Luminet-LT/dsh-inapp-chat","commit":"d3e048679286dd960c6df8ef2bbb203142e39a8f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-inapp-chat 会把用户点击后的对话导航到 chat.deepseek.com；代码通过桌面开窗桥接或网页链接打开该站点，页面本身不嵌入 Harness。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:45","lib/client.js:112-114","lib/client.js:136-149"]}
